    ISO29110V2:hasTaskDescription "Establish actions to correct deviations or problems and identified risks concerning\nthe accomplishment of the project plan/ as needed:\n- Document actions in the correction register.\n- Track actions to closure." ;
    ISO29110V2:hasTaskID "PM.3.2" ;
    ISO29110V2:hasTaskNote "NOTE: Conditional task: Track actions to closure." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/mrwit/ontologies/2026/3/ISO29110V2#PM.PT.03.03
