        ISO29110V2:SI ;
    ISO29110V2:hasBasePracticeDescription "Verify and obtain approval of the Requirements Specification.Verify the\ncorrectness and testability of the Requirements Specification and its\nconsistency with the Product Description. Additionally, review that\nrequirements are complete, unambiguous, and not contradictory. The results\nfound are documented in a Verification Results and corrections are made until\nthe document is approved by AN. If significant changes were needed, initiate a\nChange Request." ;
    ISO29110V2:hasBasePracticeID "SI.BP2" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/mrwit/ontologies/2026/3/ISO29110V2#SI.BP.03
