    ISO29110V2:hasBasePracticeDescription "Validate and obtain approval of the Requirements Specification .\nValidate that Requirements Specification satisfies needs and agreed upon\nexpectations, including the user interface usability. The results found are\ndocumented in a Validation Results and corrections are made until the\ndocument is approved by the CUS." ;
    ISO29110V2:hasBasePracticeID "SI.BP3" .


